Package: njord
Title: Parametric Windstorm Trigger Design and Basis Risk Quantification
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Campbell", , "your@email.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = ""))
Description: Parametric trigger design and basis risk quantification for UK and
    European windstorm, using ERA5/Copernicus CDS hazard footprint data. Fits
    frequency and severity models to historical storm catalogues, simulates
    synthetic event sets, and compares parametric payout EP curves against
    indemnity benchmarks to quantify and decompose basis risk by source.
